<title>NEW ZEALAND: Air NZ confirms 98.76 pct rights issue take-up.</title>
<headline>Air NZ confirms 98.76 pct rights issue take-up.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air New Zealand Ltd's recent NZ$240 million rights issue ended 98.76 percent subscribed, a company spokeswoman confirmed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rights trading finished last week.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
